1
00:00:01,430 --> 00:00:02,540
Manager!

2
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:04,970
Could you please bring that thing we talked about?

3
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:05,980
Yes.

4
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:08,950
A familiar taste. The stamina drink my wife is proud of,

5
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:11,910
made with milk and honey.

6
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:14,410
Make sure you drink it! Take it to the match!

7
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:15,370
Yes!

8
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:17,470
This really fires us up before a match.

9
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:19,460
We couldn't do without this drink, coach!

10
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,120
Do you really think so?

11
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,920
Here you go, Matsuyama-kun.

12
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,080
Ah, thank you!

13
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:33,050
By the way, this is the last tournament you'll be taking care of us, isn't it, Fujisawa?

14
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,050
Yes...

15
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:40,310
Man, it's cold.

16
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:42,560
When it snows while you're wearing thick clothes, you start

17
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:44,730
sweating and feel even colder.

18
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:47,560
Here, Matsuyama-kun, Oda-kun. Take these.

19
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:50,260
Wipe your sweat with this.

20
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:51,530
Thanks.

21
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,610
It's warm!

22
00:00:54,610 --> 00:00:57,620
Yoshiko heated them up by the stove for you.

23
00:00:57,620 --> 00:01:00,330
Really? That's very thoughtful.

24
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:12,220
Yoshiko Fujisawa will be moving to America in the second term due to her father's job.

25
00:01:16,850 --> 00:01:19,100
As the last moment before her transfer,

26
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:22,550
I will show how we become national champions.

27
00:01:22,550 --> 00:01:23,600
Yes.

28
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:27,700
Come on, give me some!

29
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:29,110
Ah, sorry.

30
00:01:29,110 --> 00:01:33,900
Don't waste your stamina in the game because of the heat.

31
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:37,410
After all, we're not used to such sweltering weather.

32
00:01:37,410 --> 00:01:39,460
Everything will be fine, coach.

33
00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:41,440
So far, no one has worn out and

34
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,410
everyone is improving their personal records.

35
00:01:43,410 --> 00:01:44,690
You're right.

36
00:01:44,690 --> 00:01:47,120
Besides, we have this stamina drink

37
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:49,520
that your lovely wife made for us.

38
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:50,670
You little...

39
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:54,630
But guys, the more we win and

40
00:01:54,630 --> 00:01:56,970
advance, the stronger our opponents will be.

41
00:01:56,970 --> 00:01:58,260
Don't let your guard down.

42
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:01,040
Today's opponent, Minamiuwa, is a good team with a balanced

43
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:03,310
offense and defense.

44
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:06,620
Pay special attention to captain Ishida's technique and

45
00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:09,060
FW, TAKEI

46
00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:09,060
CAPTAIN, ISHIDA

47
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:09,940
midfielder Takei's powerful headers.

48
00:02:09,940 --> 00:02:11,360
Okay!

49
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:14,580
Alright! If we win, we'll face Nankatsu.

50
00:02:14,580 --> 00:02:17,770
To get there, we have to completely tear Minamiuwa apart!

51
00:02:17,770 --> 00:02:18,700
Yeah!

52
00:02:19,570 --> 00:02:20,980
Yoshiko...

53
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:23,830
Aren't you going to confess to Matsuyama and tell him you love him?

54
00:02:23,830 --> 00:02:27,140
If you can't do it today, then...

