94
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:05,510
EPISODE 40:
FURANO FIGHTS

95
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:04,740
The second match of the National Middle School Football Tournament quarter-finals.

96
00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:08,510
The match between Toho Academy and Chubu MS is about to end.

97
00:04:08,510 --> 00:04:11,180
Toho is once again making first-year player Sawada

98
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:13,850
the center of their offense today.

99
00:04:13,850 --> 00:04:15,610
He's truly in a period of rapid development!

100
00:04:15,610 --> 00:04:18,240
As Toho racks up victories, Sawada-kun

101
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:20,860
continues to improve his skills.

102
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:21,440
Here!

103
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,780
Okay!

104
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:27,290
Center forward Sorimachi has taken on the role of Hyuga, who sits on the bench.

105
00:04:27,290 --> 00:04:29,370
He's in perfect sync with Sawada.

106
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:33,520
Perfect!

107
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:35,500
Sorimachi scores a third, death-blow-like goal in the dying minutes!

108
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:37,250
FURANO MIDDLE SCHOOL
HOKKAIDO

109
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:39,750
Even without Hyuga, Toho's offensive power is definitely not diminishing!

110
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:41,270
What's wrong, Hyuga?

111
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:44,180
You're sitting on the bench... Why don't you go out and play?

112
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:47,260
But Chubu isn't giving up!

113
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:49,260
They continue to attack Toho's goal.

114
00:04:49,260 --> 00:04:51,980
However, Toho has this man.

115
00:04:51,980 --> 00:04:54,920
The man with a clean sheet, Ken Wakashimazu!

116
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:57,370
No one has scored against him in this tournament yet.

117
00:04:57,370 --> 00:04:59,190
He's also the vice-captain.

118
00:04:59,190 --> 00:05:00,780
Come on...!

119
00:05:01,590 --> 00:05:03,900
The ball is lofted in front of the goal.

120
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:06,320
What?

121
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:08,990
Wakashimazu catches it easily.

122
00:05:08,990 --> 00:05:09,780
It's no use.

123
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:11,780
We can't beat him in the air either.

124
00:05:13,030 --> 00:05:14,790
The match is over!

125
00:05:14,790 --> 00:05:16,550
We did it! We won!

126
00:05:16,550 --> 00:05:17,750
We're in the top four!

127
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:19,450
3-0!

128
00:05:19,450 --> 00:05:21,380
Toho Academy wins!

129
00:05:21,380 --> 00:05:25,090
And Wakashimazu keeps a clean sheet for his fourth game!

130
00:05:25,090 --> 00:05:27,840
We did it!

131
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:30,680
One more game until the finals.

132
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,440
Every player at Toho is doing their best to compensate

133
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,560
for Hyuga's absence.

134
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:38,750
They continue to improve their skills.

135
00:05:38,750 --> 00:05:43,370
If we add a strengthened Hyuga, what kind of team will they become?

136
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:47,820
They are sure to be a fearsome and powerful team.

137
00:05:50,410 --> 00:05:53,300
Alright! We're next!

138
00:05:53,300 --> 00:05:54,540
Yeah!

139
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,580
Matsuyama-kun, wait a second.

140
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:00,320
What is it?

141
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:03,090
Yoshiko...

142
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:07,840
What's the matter? Do you need me?

143
00:06:09,210 --> 00:06:10,920
Come on, Yoshiko!

144
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,850
Yes.

145
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:14,700
Captain!

146
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:16,100
What are you doing?

147
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:17,220
Hurry up!

148
00:06:17,220 --> 00:06:19,100
Okay, I'm coming!

149
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:21,360
Hey, what happened?

150
00:06:24,260 --> 00:06:27,110
D-Do your best and win again today!

151
00:06:27,110 --> 00:06:29,360
O-Okay...

152
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,620
Is that all?

153
00:06:31,970 --> 00:06:32,910
Yes.

154
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:35,450
Of course I'll win.

155
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:39,080
What was that?

156
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:40,730
Alright! Here we go, everyone!

157
00:06:40,730 --> 00:06:42,050
Okay!

158
00:06:43,490 --> 00:06:45,090
Ah, you...

159
00:06:45,530 --> 00:06:47,940
It's fine by me.

160
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:52,450
After all, Matsuyama-kun right now is

161
00:06:52,450 --> 00:06:55,850
thinking about how to win this match.

162
00:06:58,350 --> 00:06:59,560
Let's go, Furano!

163
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,280
Fight, Furano!

164
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,980
Yes! Yes! Yes!

165
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:05,980
They're shouting loudly as usual.

166
00:07:05,980 --> 00:07:07,980
Furano Eleven, representing Hokkaido!

167
00:07:07,980 --> 00:07:11,610
Good luck, good luck, Furano!

168
00:07:11,610 --> 00:07:16,490
Their opponent, Minamiuwa MS from Ehime, waits for them quietly.

169
00:07:16,490 --> 00:07:18,230
Everything's fine.

170
00:07:18,230 --> 00:07:20,010
We'll defeat Furano and be in the top four.

171
00:07:20,010 --> 00:07:23,580
Then we'll play against the previous champion Nankatsu.

172
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:27,360
This is the third quarter-final match of the semi-finals.

173
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,470
Furano MS vs. Minamiuwa MS.

174
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:31,010
The match begins!

175
00:07:32,130 --> 00:07:34,470
Furano gets the ball first.

176
00:07:34,470 --> 00:07:37,120
Alright. We'll score the first goal again today.

177
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,770
Yeah!

178
00:07:37,770 --> 00:07:39,390
Come on, Matsuyama!

179
00:07:39,390 --> 00:07:43,130
Minamiuwa's captain Ishida goes to mark him!

180
00:07:43,130 --> 00:07:45,650
A one-on-one battle between the captains?

181
00:07:45,650 --> 00:07:46,900
Here, Wakamatsu!

182
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:50,950
Are you afraid to go up against me?

183
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:53,500
I'm not afraid of you at all.

184
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:56,160
But football is a team sport. That's all.

185
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:58,620
Are you sure about that?

186
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:02,120
You'd better say you trust your friends,

187
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:04,310
but doesn't that actually mean you don't trust

188
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:06,500
your own ball control skills?

189
00:08:07,300 --> 00:08:10,170
Minamiuwa makes a masterful pass this time.

190
00:08:10,170 --> 00:08:11,670
Okay, come on!

191
00:08:11,670 --> 00:08:14,470
Without a moment's delay, they send the ball
to their captain Ishida.

192
00:08:15,220 --> 00:08:16,720
I'll do it in one go!

193
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:17,930
Everyone fall back!

194
00:08:17,930 --> 00:08:22,440
Ishida is known for his technique and attacks with solo dribbling.

195
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:25,190
Furano goes to mark him under Matsuyama's orders.

196
00:08:25,190 --> 00:08:27,980
However, Minamiuwa immediately surrounds them.

197
00:08:27,980 --> 00:08:29,360
Ishida!

198
00:08:31,250 --> 00:08:33,510
Ishida breaks through the middle!

199
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:36,070
Furano thought he would pass, so they let him through!

200
00:08:36,070 --> 00:08:37,990
Damn it! He's looking down on us!

201
00:08:39,030 --> 00:08:39,740
Go!

202
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:42,250
However, Ishida aimed short of the goal.

203
00:08:43,010 --> 00:08:46,500
A desperate tactic to avoid Matsuyama's challenge?

204
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:47,970
Did he just lob the ball up?

205
00:08:47,970 --> 00:08:48,920
Okay!

206
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:51,730
Here I go!

207
00:08:51,730 --> 00:08:54,150
A player is sprinting from the wing!

208
00:08:54,150 --> 00:08:56,760
That's Minamiuwa's center forward, Takei!

209
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:58,510
Good! Keep it up, Takei!

210
00:08:58,510 --> 00:08:59,140
What?!

211
00:08:59,980 --> 00:09:01,510
Takei jumps!

212
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:04,100
An aerial duel between him and the goalkeeper.

213
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,590
Goal!

214
00:09:08,590 --> 00:09:10,340
Minamiuwa opens the scoring.

215
00:09:10,340 --> 00:09:11,860
Takei won the duel!

216
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:14,450
Did they get ahead of Furano?

217
00:09:14,450 --> 00:09:16,200
You did it, Takei!

218
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,050
Yeah.

219
00:09:17,050 --> 00:09:19,660
Being a championship contender means nothing to me!

220
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:22,310
This is an unexpected development!

221
00:09:22,310 --> 00:09:26,710
For the first time in the tournament, Furano concedes the first goal.

222
00:09:26,710 --> 00:09:28,460
Matsuyama-kun...

223
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:31,880
Despite being seen as the weaker team, Minamiuwa initiated the scoring!

224
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:36,380
How will Furano stand up after this?

225
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:39,010
Please win, Matsuyama-kun. Please...

226
00:09:41,470 --> 00:09:44,340
Furano regroups and attacks.

227
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:46,730
What?!

228
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,300
Alright!

229
00:09:50,300 --> 00:09:52,190
Minamiuwa intercepts the passes again.

230
00:09:52,190 --> 00:09:54,040
Once more! Let's get another one!

231
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:56,150
Did that first goal boost their morale?

232
00:09:56,150 --> 00:09:58,150
Minamiuwa has nice moves.

233
00:09:58,150 --> 00:10:00,660
Everyone! Don't panic just because we lost the first goal.

234
00:10:00,660 --> 00:10:03,240
Calm down and show them the results of our training!

235
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,370
Yeah!

236
00:10:04,950 --> 00:10:06,330
Okay!

237
00:10:06,330 --> 00:10:07,780
I wonder if Furano's mood has changed

238
00:10:07,780 --> 00:10:09,220
after Matsuyama's words.

239
00:10:09,220 --> 00:10:11,060
They intercepted the pass this time.

240
00:10:11,060 --> 00:10:12,250
For you, captain!

241
00:10:12,250 --> 00:10:13,550
Alright!

242
00:10:13,550 --> 00:10:16,640
They're completely reading our passes right now.

243
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:17,340
If that's the case...

244
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:20,400
Then I'll do it myself!

245
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:22,400
Matsuyama dashes towards the opponent's goal!

246
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:24,810
He's showing his fluid dribbling skills!

247
00:10:24,810 --> 00:10:27,140
Ridiculous! He didn't pass!

248
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:29,650
Will Matsuyama continue and take a shot?

249
00:10:30,230 --> 00:10:31,600
This is for you, Matsuyama.

250
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,670
Too bad, I knew you'd try this!

251
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:35,400
I won't let you shoot!

252
00:10:36,610 --> 00:10:40,610
Just when we thought he would shoot, Matsuyama passed!

253
00:10:40,610 --> 00:10:41,450
What?!

254
00:10:41,450 --> 00:10:43,120
Oda! Help!

255
00:10:43,540 --> 00:10:45,660
The ball goes to the unmarked Oda!

256
00:10:45,660 --> 00:10:47,380
Okay! I'll handle it!

257
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:49,580
Oda takes aim and shoots!

258
00:10:50,250 --> 00:10:52,530
He misses!

259
00:10:53,210 --> 00:10:54,550
What?!

260
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:56,420
I was lucky.

261
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,650
Never mind! Never mind!

262
00:10:58,650 --> 00:11:01,480
Don't worry. These things happen.

263
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,930
S-Sorry.

264
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:05,930
It seems fortune is on our side.

265
00:11:09,190 --> 00:11:10,980
Alright, let's go for another goal!

266
00:11:11,420 --> 00:11:13,030
A chance for Minamiuwa.

267
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:15,770
Ishida sends the ball towards the goal.

268
00:11:15,770 --> 00:11:17,650
Do you really think we'll fall for the same trick?

269
00:11:17,650 --> 00:11:18,820
Don't underestimate...

270
00:11:18,820 --> 00:11:19,990
Furano!

271
00:11:22,030 --> 00:11:24,660
This time, all the defenders stop the attack.

272
00:11:26,660 --> 00:11:28,150
Nice defense!

273
00:11:28,150 --> 00:11:30,330
Furano protects their goal this time.

274
00:11:30,330 --> 00:11:33,330
Hehh. That was pretty dangerous.

275
00:11:33,330 --> 00:11:35,480
Furano is unexpectedly having a hard time.

276
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:37,240
Minamiuwa, huh...

277
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:39,720
This must be what they call a "dark horse"...

278
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:41,240
Right.

279
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:43,450
We need to be careful too.

280
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:48,350
Damn it!

281
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:51,440
The first half ends here.

282
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:53,350
What are you dawdling for?

283
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:54,870
1-0!

284
00:11:54,870 --> 00:11:57,360
It ends with Minamiuwa leading by a single goal.

285
00:11:57,360 --> 00:12:00,610
Let's go. We should start warming up too.

286
00:12:00,610 --> 00:12:01,520
Yes.

287
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:04,370
We don't want to struggle against a dark horse.

288
00:12:04,370 --> 00:12:07,400
Oh no! At this rate, we're going to lose...

289
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:08,020
Yes.

290
00:12:08,020 --> 00:12:09,500
What do you mean "yes"?!

291
00:12:09,500 --> 00:12:15,300
Yoshiko, if we lose,
you'll leave Matsuyama forever!

292
00:12:16,540 --> 00:12:18,530
Do you understand, Yoshiko?

293
00:12:18,530 --> 00:12:21,970
Your father is waiting for us in America.

294
00:12:21,970 --> 00:12:26,770
Sorry. We were supposed to join him
right after the first term ended, but—

295
00:12:26,770 --> 00:12:30,250
You've worked so hard as a manager until now, so I understand

296
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:33,730
you want to watch them until the last match, but...

297
00:12:33,730 --> 00:12:37,060
If we lose, I'll leave immediately.

298
00:12:37,060 --> 00:12:38,800
I guess that will be fine.

299
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:39,730
Yes.

300
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,070
Matsuyama-kun...

301
00:12:44,350 --> 00:12:53,120
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

302
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:55,580
MINAMIUWA MIDDLE SCHOOL
EHIME

303
00:12:54,370 --> 00:12:55,580
Alright, everyone.

304
00:12:55,580 --> 00:12:58,090
You did a perfect job in the first half.

305
00:12:58,090 --> 00:13:00,350
The weather will get much hotter.

306
00:13:00,350 --> 00:13:02,290
Our opponent will tire out.

307
00:13:02,290 --> 00:13:04,200
Stick to the plan. Don't show any weakness!

308
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,090
Yes, sir!

309
00:13:05,090 --> 00:13:08,140
We'll score one more goal in the second half and win.

310
00:13:08,140 --> 00:13:09,100
Yes.

311
00:13:09,100 --> 00:13:10,850
FURANO MIDDLE SCHOOL
HOKKAIDO

312
00:13:10,850 --> 00:13:13,310
Sorry, it's because of me.

313
00:13:13,310 --> 00:13:14,650
If I had scored that...

314
00:13:14,650 --> 00:13:16,970
Don't worry, Oda.

315
00:13:16,970 --> 00:13:17,900
Yes.

316
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:19,440
Just work hard in the second half.

317
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,610
Okay.

318
00:13:20,610 --> 00:13:22,130
We still have 30 minutes.

319
00:13:22,130 --> 00:13:23,320
Let's stay calm and keep going.

320
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:25,360
We can't do anything about the goal we conceded.

321
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:27,320
First, we have to equalize.

322
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:29,800
If we do that, we can set our rhythm and win.

323
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:31,670
Believe in yourselves, everyone!

324
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:32,580
Yes, sir!

325
00:13:33,260 --> 00:13:34,380
Damn it!

326
00:13:34,380 --> 00:13:38,670
If we're struggling at this point,
there's no way we can become champions.

327
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:39,620
Don't lose!

328
00:13:39,620 --> 00:13:43,670
The sun is now shining even brighter
and the temperature is about 36°C.

329
00:13:43,670 --> 00:13:47,220
It will also be a battle against the heat.

330
00:13:47,220 --> 00:13:49,720
The second half finally begins.

331
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:52,380
I believe in you, Matsuyama-kun.

332
00:13:52,380 --> 00:13:53,640
I believe in you.

333
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:57,930
Minamiuwa attacks fiercely!

334
00:13:57,930 --> 00:13:59,460
They're aiming for a second goal.

335
00:13:59,460 --> 00:14:00,700
Here we go!

336
00:14:00,700 --> 00:14:03,150
We'll score another goal and finish this match.

337
00:14:03,150 --> 00:14:04,280
Don't lose your head!

338
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:06,360
No matter what, we won't allow a second goal!

339
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:12,510
Minamiuwa is truly a good team.

340
00:14:12,510 --> 00:14:16,330
It's no coincidence they've been able to keep this game at 1-0 so far.

341
00:14:16,330 --> 00:14:18,040
That's right.

342
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:22,330
Minamiuwa is the strongest team in my coaching career.

343
00:14:22,330 --> 00:14:25,330
They rose to the top of Shikoku, and now

344
00:14:25,330 --> 00:14:28,340
this team will dominate the National Tournament.

345
00:14:29,140 --> 00:14:31,350
A flawless attack from Minamiuwa!

346
00:14:31,350 --> 00:14:34,220
On the other hand, have the Furano players from Hokkaido,

347
00:14:34,220 --> 00:14:36,890
unaccustomed to this heat, started to lose stamina?

348
00:14:36,890 --> 00:14:38,130
Do your best!

349
00:14:38,130 --> 00:14:39,900
Grit your teeth, everyone!

350
00:14:42,150 --> 00:14:44,120
What's the matter, Matsuyama?

351
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:46,440
Weren't you going to pay me back?

352
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:47,640
Damn it!

353
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:49,700
If we concede a second goal, it's all over.

354
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:52,410
We know that better than anyone!

355
00:14:53,420 --> 00:14:54,410
He got the ball!

356
00:14:54,410 --> 00:14:57,020
The team's cornerstone, Furano's captain Matsuyama!

357
00:14:57,020 --> 00:14:58,710
He finally managed to steal the ball!

358
00:15:00,210 --> 00:15:02,470
He's bringing the ball up all alone!

359
00:15:02,470 --> 00:15:05,920
He's called the player with the best ball control in this tournament.

360
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:07,380
Kaneda!

361
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:09,760
Also the second best at passing!

362
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:12,760
Truly, Furano's Commander, Hikaru Matsuyama!

363
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:13,970
Matsuyama-kun!

364
00:15:14,380 --> 00:15:15,390
Nice pass!

365
00:15:15,390 --> 00:15:16,420
Read their passes!

366
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:17,470
We have to stop them!

367
00:15:19,180 --> 00:15:20,230
Here!

368
00:15:20,230 --> 00:15:24,360
A rare long pass from Furano, who usually plays with short passes.

369
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,470
Bad, fall back!

370
00:15:26,470 --> 00:15:27,990
Cover the front of the goal!

371
00:15:27,990 --> 00:15:30,030
I'll send a cross before you do!

372
00:15:30,030 --> 00:15:31,780
A perfect cross!

373
00:15:31,780 --> 00:15:33,160
The ball goes to Oda!

374
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,280
This time...!

375
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:39,500
Straight to the goalkeeper!

376
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:41,320
A tough one.

377
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:43,700
Oda misses another scoring chance.

378
00:15:43,700 --> 00:15:45,170
That makes two.

379
00:15:45,170 --> 00:15:46,520
Oda...

380
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:49,010
Okay, send it before it's too late!

381
00:15:49,010 --> 00:15:50,920
Matsuyama can't get back!

382
00:15:51,500 --> 00:15:54,180
Counter-attack from Minamiuwa!

383
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:55,550
Everyone, I trust you!

384
00:15:55,550 --> 00:15:56,980
God, I beg you.

385
00:15:56,980 --> 00:15:58,770
Let them win.

386
00:15:58,770 --> 00:16:03,480
It's too cruel for Yoshiko and Matsuyama to be separated like this.

387
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,940
Takei is being held.

388
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:10,240
Then...

389
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:11,450
Time to shoot!

390
00:16:11,930 --> 00:16:14,530
Ishida suddenly took a long shot.

391
00:16:16,920 --> 00:16:18,470
Caught it!

392
00:16:18,470 --> 00:16:20,120
The goalkeeper makes a great play!

393
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:22,120
An extraordinary save from Kato-kun.

394
00:16:22,870 --> 00:16:24,080
Come on, Kato!

395
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:26,510
It's time to stop showing them
such a struggle!

396
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:29,380
Do you really think Furano could lose to a team like that?!

397
00:16:29,970 --> 00:16:31,010
Captain...!

398
00:16:31,010 --> 00:16:32,380
Matsuyama-kun!

399
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:33,380
Captain!

400
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:36,430
Kato-kun, who perfectly guarded his goal,

401
00:16:36,430 --> 00:16:38,430
sends a long pass to captain Matsuyama.

402
00:16:39,770 --> 00:16:40,600
Alright!

403
00:16:41,390 --> 00:16:43,690
Can Furano catch up and take the lead?!

404
00:16:43,690 --> 00:16:46,150
Only ten minutes left in the match.

405
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:48,140
Follow the captain's lead, everyone!

406
00:16:48,140 --> 00:16:49,410
Just as the captain said!

407
00:16:49,410 --> 00:16:52,530
Are we going to lose to these guys?!

408
00:16:52,530 --> 00:16:53,510
He's right!

409
00:16:53,510 --> 00:16:56,530
We can't afford to lose!

410
00:16:56,530 --> 00:16:58,530
Follow the captain's lead!

411
00:16:59,810 --> 00:17:01,060
T-This...

412
00:17:01,060 --> 00:17:03,040
Furano attacks with all its players!

413
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:05,290
They're all running, aiming for the goal!

414
00:17:05,290 --> 00:17:07,540
They believe so much.

415
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:10,330
Above all, you can really see Furano's teamwork...

416
00:17:10,330 --> 00:17:13,090
Everyone unites under a single command from Matsuyama.

417
00:17:13,090 --> 00:17:14,590
Matsuyama...

418
00:17:14,590 --> 00:17:16,010
Don't panic, everyone!

419
00:17:16,010 --> 00:17:17,240
We still have 10 minutes!

420
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:21,600
If we keep reading their passes,
Furano won't be able to score against us!

421
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:23,060
Y-Yeah...

422
00:17:25,270 --> 00:17:26,940
Matsuyama-kun...

423
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:27,940
Damn it...

424
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:30,770
I can't lose to guys like these!

425
00:17:31,220 --> 00:17:32,900
Hey, soccer club!

426
00:17:33,900 --> 00:17:37,280
Your time is up. It's our turn to use the gym.

427
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:38,660
Okay!

428
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:42,080
Okay! We'll just clear the front and keep practicing.

429
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:42,950
Yes!

430
00:17:42,950 --> 00:17:43,660
Here!

431
00:17:45,830 --> 00:17:47,440
Damn it...

432
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:50,130
We can't practice like this.

433
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:56,840
Damn it!

434
00:17:56,840 --> 00:18:06,560
We can't lose to those who play
year-round on bare ground!

435
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:18,990
Matsuyama doesn't even pass before a long, long shot!

436
00:18:18,990 --> 00:18:20,240
What?!

437
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:22,030
Our captain's special shot!

438
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:24,700
A sharp shot that seems to skim the ground!

439
00:18:24,700 --> 00:18:29,290
Minamiuwa, who had been reading the passes until now, is completely deceived!

440
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,430
Goal!

441
00:18:33,430 --> 00:18:36,340
A long shot with all of Matsuyama's power!

442
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:39,240
Furano finally ties the score!

443
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:43,850
Unlike you, we had to keep working even under these conditions.

444
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:47,100
We'll show you the determination of those of us who trained in the snow!

445
00:18:47,780 --> 00:18:51,850
The kind of shot he can take with the power built through training on rough ground.

446
00:18:51,850 --> 00:18:53,900
I call this the North Country Shot!

447
00:18:53,900 --> 00:18:55,470
You did it, Captain!

448
00:18:55,470 --> 00:18:56,400
We caught them!

449
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:58,400
We did it, Yoshiko! We caught them!

450
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,400
Yes!

451
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:02,170
That was a great shot.

452
00:19:02,170 --> 00:19:05,580
Matsuyama is hiding that kind of fighting spirit...

453
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:09,580
Still, that long shot that skims the ground...

454
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:11,480
Very powerful.

455
00:19:11,500 --> 00:19:13,920
He can make such a shot because he strengthens his lower body

456
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:16,340
on snowy ground, right?

457
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:18,350
Yes. And the others successfully positioned themselves

458
00:19:18,350 --> 00:19:20,350
to receive passes,

459
00:19:20,350 --> 00:19:22,930
forcing the defense to focus only on Matsuyama.

460
00:19:22,930 --> 00:19:25,930
It's as if they scored this equalizer with all eleven players.

461
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:30,100
You still need another goal, Matsuyama.

462
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:33,310
After tying the game, Furano's momentum continues.

463
00:19:33,770 --> 00:19:35,980
They intercepted the pass!

464
00:19:35,980 --> 00:19:36,980
Watch out!

465
00:19:36,980 --> 00:19:38,740
Matsuyama can do more than just pass!

466
00:19:38,740 --> 00:19:41,030
He can also dribble and take long shots!

467
00:19:42,110 --> 00:19:43,810
The others can only pass!

468
00:19:43,810 --> 00:19:45,120
Read their pass direction!

469
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:47,420
Kaneda-kun keeps dribbling.

470
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:48,120
What?

471
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:52,080
This is a complete attack combining football basics, dribbling and passing.

472
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:53,330
Guys...

473
00:19:53,330 --> 00:19:57,710
Furano's players seemed exhausted, but they seem perfectly fine.

474
00:19:57,710 --> 00:20:00,220
No. They are all fighting fatigue now.

475
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:03,840
And Matsuyama is the one holding everyone together.

476
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:05,890
Everyone, keep fighting!

477
00:20:06,850 --> 00:20:08,940
The ball goes to Matsuyama once more,

478
00:20:08,940 --> 00:20:11,020
right in front of Minamiuwa's goal!

479
00:20:11,020 --> 00:20:12,980
I won't let you shoot again!

480
00:20:12,980 --> 00:20:17,110
Ishida, I'll personally take you on as I please!

481
00:20:17,930 --> 00:20:19,300
Ahh Matsuyama-kun

482
00:20:19,300 --> 00:20:22,450
He plans to get past Ishida all by himself!

483
00:20:22,450 --> 00:20:23,910
Matsuyama-kun!

484
00:20:23,910 --> 00:20:25,660
Do you think you can get past me?

485
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:26,660
I will!

486
00:20:28,220 --> 00:20:29,800
He got past him!

487
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:33,330
Matsuyama clearly wins this battle between captains!

488
00:20:34,140 --> 00:20:37,840
He passed Ishida... He lost in terms of ball technique...

489
00:20:37,840 --> 00:20:40,300
There's no one to stop Matsuyama in front of the goal!

490
00:20:40,300 --> 00:20:41,780
This is a huge chance!

491
00:20:41,780 --> 00:20:42,380
Take this!

492
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:43,090
What?

493
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:44,970
Captain!

494
00:20:44,970 --> 00:20:47,200
This is for you, Oda!

495
00:20:47,200 --> 00:20:49,810
You're Furano's center forward!

496
00:20:49,810 --> 00:20:51,410
He's right. Just shoot, Oda!

497
00:20:51,410 --> 00:20:53,310
Do it like you always do during practice!

498
00:20:53,310 --> 00:20:54,760
Captain...

499
00:20:54,760 --> 00:20:56,190
Everyone...

500
00:20:56,190 --> 00:20:58,540
Even though I failed you twice today, you...

501
00:20:59,470 --> 00:21:00,670
Damn it!

502
00:21:00,670 --> 00:21:03,030
If I can't score, I can't call myself a man!

503
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:04,650
Go!

504
00:21:07,620 --> 00:21:08,660
It's in!

505
00:21:08,660 --> 00:21:11,580
His third attempt, and this time he converts

506
00:21:11,580 --> 00:21:14,500
this chance in a magnificent way!

507
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:16,530
I-I did it!

508
00:21:16,530 --> 00:21:17,750
Furano turns the score around.

509
00:21:18,350 --> 00:21:20,400
They lead, 2-1!

510
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:22,260
Everything's fine.

511
00:21:22,260 --> 00:21:23,570
Damn it...

512
00:21:23,570 --> 00:21:25,180
They're ahead!

513
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:30,440
The final whistle blows and the match is over!

514
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:33,270
Minamiuwa is finally powerless and Furano secures their place

515
00:21:33,270 --> 00:21:36,100
in the top four with this comeback victory!

516
00:21:36,100 --> 00:21:37,480
We won!

517
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:39,840
Alright! Next is Nankatsu!

518
00:21:39,840 --> 00:21:41,730
And we'll catch Toho in the finals!

519
00:21:41,730 --> 00:21:44,240
So you won, Matsuyama...

520
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:46,990
As expected from the stubborn Furano.

521
00:21:46,990 --> 00:21:48,940
That last goal...

522
00:21:48,940 --> 00:21:52,000
Matsuyama could have easily done it himself.

523
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:56,340
But, he deliberately sent a pass to Oda, who was in bad form today.

524
00:21:56,340 --> 00:21:57,800
Matsuyama-kun...

525
00:21:57,800 --> 00:22:01,630
Your faith in your teammates runs deep, doesn't it?

526
00:22:01,630 --> 00:22:04,250
We won! We won, Yoshiko!

527
00:22:04,250 --> 00:22:06,380
Yes... I'm so glad!

528
00:22:06,380 --> 00:22:08,130
Manager!

529
00:22:08,130 --> 00:22:10,130
We won again today!

530
00:22:10,130 --> 00:22:11,700
Matsuyama-kun...

531
00:22:13,950 --> 00:22:15,260
Fujisawa...

532
00:22:15,260 --> 00:22:18,570
Your last moments with us will be what you wished for.

533
00:22:20,150 --> 00:22:35,150
~Anime Lovers~
You can share your thoughts about this episode under our Instagram posts...

534
00:22:38,870 --> 00:22:44,920
chotto are mi na ace ga tooru

535
00:22:38,870 --> 00:22:44,920
Hey, look at that ace passing by.

536
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:50,930
suguremono zo to machijû sawagu

537
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:50,930
He's the best and the whole city is proud of him.

538
00:22:50,930 --> 00:22:56,980
chô-chô samba, zigzag samba

539
00:22:50,930 --> 00:22:56,980
Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba

540
00:22:56,980 --> 00:23:01,610
